,"html_url":"https://github.com/kenips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kenips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/43697714","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/14994#issuecomment-43697714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/14994","id":43697714,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzNjk3NzE0","user":{"login":"maxwell","id":69663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell","html_url":"https://github.com/maxwell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-05-20T23:52:33Z","updated_at":"2014-05-20T23:52:45Z","body":"I had the issue after trying 4-1-stable after my rails 4.1.1 upgrade went a little hairwire.\n\nAfter trying the ref with this fix, I still had a couple of issues which seemed to arise from the patch.\n\nNamely, if a given association was already included/preloaded, I got a \n\n``` ruby\nNoMethodError: undefined method `association' for nil:NilClass error.\n```\n\n   In debugging the issue, I noticed compacting the refs on line 119 solved my issue.\n\n@tenderlove, here are two reproducible test cases, one which is derived from my application, and another which is more generic.\n\nNote, Removing the preload or duplicate includes does fix the issue, but this code did not explode in rails 4, but does now on 4.1.1 and 4-1-stable.  \n\nPlease let me know if you want me to open a new bug report.\n\nThank you!!\n\n``` ruby\n\n#activate the gem you are reporting the issue against.\nrequire 'active_record'\nrequire 'minitest/autorun'\nrequire 'logger'\n\n# Ensure backward compatibility with Minitest 4\nMinitest::Test = MiniTest::Unit::TestCase unless defined?(Minitest::Test)\n\n# This connection will do for database-independent bug reports.\nActiveRecord::Base.establish_connection(adapter: 'sqlite3', database: ':memory:')\nActiveRecord::Base.logger = Logger.new(STDOUT)\n\nActiveRecord::Schema.define do\n\n  create_table :customers, force: true \n\n  create_table :orders, force: true do |t|\n    t.integer 'customer_id'\n  end\n\n  create_table :line_items, force:true do |t|\n    t.integer 'variant_id'\n    t.integer 'order_id'\n  end\n\n  create_table :variants, force:true\nend\n\nclass Customer < ActiveRecord::Base\n  has_one :order\n\n  scope :borked_includes, -> { includes(:order => :variants)}\n  scope :not_ordered, lambda { joins('LEFT OUTER JOIN \"orders\" ON \"orders\".\"customer_id\" = \"customers\".\"id\" ').where('orders.id is null').preload(:order  ) }\n\nend\n\nclass Order < ActiveRecord::Base\n  has_many :line_items\n  has_many :variants, through: :line_items\nend\n\nclass LineItem < ActiveRecord::Base\n    belongs_to :order\n    belongs_to :variant\nend\n\nclass Variant < ActiveRecord::Base\n  has_many :line_items\n  has_many :orders, through: :line_items\nend\n\nclass BugTest < Minitest::Test\n  def test_association_stuff\n    customer1 = Customer.create\n    customer2 = Customer.create\n    customer3 = Customer.create\n\n\n    variant1= Variant.create\n    variant2= Variant.create\n    order1 = Order.create(customer_id: customer1.id, line_items:[LineItem.new(variant_id: variant1.id), LineItem.new(variant_id:variant2.id)])\n\n\n    # customers = Customer.not_ordered.borked_includes.all.to_a #explodes\n\n    # puts customers.map{|x| x.order.variants }\n  end\n  def test_association_stuff_again\n    customer1 = Customer.create\n    customer2 = Customer.create\n    customer3 = Customer.create\n\n\n    variant1= Variant.create\n    variant2= Variant.create\n    order1 = Order.create(customer_id: customer1.id, line_items:[LineItem.new(variant_id: variant1.id), LineItem.new(variant_id:variant2.id)])\n    #Customer.borked_includes.preload(:order).all.to_a #explodes\n  end\nend\n\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/43697714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"maxwell","id":69663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell","html_url":"https://github.com/maxwell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/maxwell/subscripti